  era: "c. 1500\u20131000 BCE \xB7 Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Early Vedic religion
  text: 'Rigvedic people worshipped the forces of nature: Indra, god of thunder and war; Agni, fire; Varuna, guardian of cosmic order; and Soma. Worship centred on hymns and offerings into fire. There were no temples or images.'
